    "answer": {
      "short": "All three have domain $\\{0,1\\}$ and ordered pairs $\\{(0,0),(1,1)\\}$, so $f=g=h$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}g(0)&=0^2=0=f(0)=h(0)\\\\g(1)&=1^2=1=f(1)=h(1)\\end{align*}$$\nAll three have domain $\\{0,1\\}$ and assign the same output to each input. Hence $f=g=h$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
